*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FRD0013
*> PURPOSE : FRAUD SCORING RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-04-19 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-11-06 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 558
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FRDNIGHT STEP040
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0013.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY FRD0013C.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    *> MANUAL REVIEW FLAG
    05 RVW-IND            PIC X VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM MINOR-TXN-CHECK
    PERFORM CHECK-REGION
    DISPLAY "RVW-IND=" RVW-IND
    STOP RUN.
MINOR-TXN-CHECK.
    *> HIGH-VALUE TRANSACTION BY MINOR
    IF CUST-AGE < 18
       AND TXN-AMT > 4500
        MOVE 'Y' TO RVW-IND
    END-IF.
CHECK-REGION.
    *> LARGE TRANSACTION FROM HIGH-RISK REGION
    IF TXN-AMT > 80000.00 AND (CNTRY-CODE = 'XB' OR 'XD')
        MOVE 'Y' TO RVW-IND
        CALL 'FRDALERT' USING INPUT-AREA
            ON EXCEPTION CONTINUE
        END-CALL
    END-IF.
